# Polje safety

- Every actuator needs a local timeout and safe default (usually OFF / last-safe).
- Cloud must never be the only safety layer. Edge is write-leader for valves.
- High-risk tools (`run_irrigation`, `set_actuator`, `fps_open_valve`, climate setpoints) require `confirm: true` + `reason`. Without confirm → return proposal only.
- Irrigation duration caps; rain lockout for drip (never lock out an armed frost program).
- Log who / what / why / before / after in `audit` — humans and agents.
- Do not enable high-risk automations in seed data.
